为呼揭王。因匈奴陷入内乱，他于前57年自立单于，并与乌藉单于相呼应，形成五单于分立。在被屠耆单于攻打，自废单于封号，再度臣服。","link_td_id":"Q10008633","link_td_number_id":356593,"people_name":"呼揭","people_name_jianti_auto":"呼揭","people_xingming":"呼揭单于","start_index":196,"tongjian_id":"9128b94c-db0e-11ef-9258-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"車犂單于","people_name_jianti_auto":"车犂单于","start_index":209,"tongjian_id":"9128b94e-db0e-11ef-bd0b-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-56,"link_td_description":"屠耆单于，因匈奴语“屠耆”意为“贤”，名薄胥堂，又称贤单于，为亚洲古匈奴的君主之一，他于前58年自立匈奴单于，打败数位自立为单于的人。前56年兵败，自杀身亡。","link_td_id":"Q10000893","link_td_number_id":356592,"people_name":"屠耆單于","people_name_jianti_auto":"屠耆单于","start_index":214,"tongjian_id":"9128b94f-db0e-11ef-a569-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[挛鞮薄胥堂]"},{"people_name":"呼韓邪單于","people_name_jianti_auto":"呼韩邪单于","start_index":239,"tongjian_id":"9128b950-db0e-11ef-9535-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[挛鞮稽侯狦]"},{"people_name":"車犂單于","people_name_jianti_auto":"车犂单于","start_index":252,"tongjian_id":"9128b951-db0e-11ef-9fae-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"車犂單于","people_name_jianti_auto":"车犂单于","start_index":257,"tongjian_id":"9128b952-db0e-11ef-a09f-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-56,"link_td_description":"屠耆单于，因匈奴语“屠耆”意为“贤”，名薄胥堂，又称贤单于，为亚洲古匈奴的君主之一，他于前58年自立匈奴单于，打败数位自立为单于的人。前56年兵败，自杀身亡。","link_td_id":"Q10000893","link_td_number_id":356592,"people_name":"屠耆單于","people_name_jianti_auto":"屠耆单于","start_index":267,"tongjian_id":"9128b953-db0e-11ef-9ca0-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[挛鞮薄胥堂]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","resolved_place_entity_id":104,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"9128b937-db0e-11ef-b41b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"烏藉","place_name_jianti_auto":"乌藉","resolved_place_entity_id":4981,"start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"9128b938-db0e-11ef-a8d8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"烏藉","place_name_jianti_auto":"乌藉","resolved_place_entity_id":4981,"start_index":129,"tongjian_id":"9128b94d-db0e-11ef-b6ab-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"闟敦","place_name_jianti_auto":"闟敦","resolved_place_entity_id":9604,"start_index":277,"tongjian_id":"9128b954-db0e-11ef-8771-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"汉匈战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0568"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十四、哈密卫（卷六十五）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"胡氏曰：呼揭在乌孙之东、匈奴西北，一曰乌揭。汉黄龙元年，...","context_before":"...匈奴遗汉书，楼兰、乌孙、呼揭及其旁二十六国，皆已为匈奴。","source_end_index":294,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"624b35da-0b41-5e76-a9dd-29fc29347809","source_start_index":270,"source_text":"又宣帝时，匈奴乖乱，其西方呼揭王自立为呼揭单于。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/十四、哈密卫（卷六十五）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事","权争"],"content":"3秋，七月，匈奴屠耆單于使先賢撣兄右奧鞬王與烏藉都尉各二萬騎屯東方，以備呼韓邪單于。是時西方呼揭王來與唯犂當戶謀，共讒右賢王，言欲自立爲單于。屠耆單于殺右賢王父子；後知其冤，復殺唯犂當戶，於是呼揭王恐，遂畔去，自立爲呼揭單于。右奧鞬王聞之，卽自立爲車犂單于。烏藉都尉亦自立爲烏藉單于。凡五單于。屠耆單于自將兵東擊車犂單于，使都隆奇擊烏藉。烏藉、車犂皆敗，西北走，與呼揭單于兵合爲四萬人。烏藉、呼揭皆去單于號，共幷力尊輔車犂單于。屠耆單于聞之，使左大將、都尉將四萬騎分屯東方，以備呼韓邪單于，自將四萬騎西擊車犂單于。車犂單于敗，西北走。屠耆單于卽引兵西南留闟敦地。","content_fanyi":"秋七月，匈奴屠耆单于派遣先贤掸的兄长右奥鞬王与乌藉都尉各自统领二万骑兵屯驻东方，用来防备呼韩邪单于。这时，西方呼揭王前来与唯犁当户密谋，共同诬陷右贤王，声称他想自立为单于。屠耆单于杀死右贤王父子；事后知道右贤王冤枉，又杀了唯犁当户，呼揭王因此恐惧，便叛逃离去，自立为呼揭单于。右奥鞬王听到这个消息，立即自立为车犁单于。乌藉都尉也自立为乌藉单于。总计共有五位单于。屠耆单于亲自领兵向东讨伐车犁单于，派都隆奇攻打乌藉。乌藉、车犁都失败，向西北逃奔，与呼揭单于的军队合在一起，共有四万人。乌藉、呼揭都去掉单于称号，合力尊奉辅助车犁单于。屠耆单于听说后，派左大将、都尉率领四万骑兵分驻东方，用来防备呼韩邪单于，并亲自率领四万骑兵向西攻击车犁单于。车犁单于战败，向西北逃奔。屠耆单于随即领兵向西南，停留在闟敦之地。","content_jianti_auto":"3秋，七月，匈奴屠耆单于使先贤掸兄右奥鞬王与乌藉都尉各二万骑屯东方，以备呼韩邪单于。是时西方呼揭王来与唯犂当户谋，共谗右贤王，言欲自立为单于。屠耆单于杀右贤王父子；后知其冤，复杀唯犂当户，于是呼揭王恐，遂畔去，自立为呼揭单于。右奥鞬王闻之，即自立为车犂单于。乌藉都尉亦自立为乌藉单于。凡五单于。屠耆单于自将兵东击车犂单于，使都隆奇击乌藉。乌藉、车犂皆败，西北走，与呼揭单于兵合为四万人。乌藉、呼揭皆去单于号，共幷力尊辅车犂单于。屠耆单于闻之，使左大将、都尉将四万骑分屯东方，以备呼韩邪单于，自将四万骑西击车犂单于。车犂单于败，西北走。屠耆单于即引兵西南留闟敦地。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2123,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"9128b927-db0e-11ef-a2de-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"912aef6d-db0e-11ef-82fc-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"士匄","people_name_jianti_auto":"士匄","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"912aef6e-db0e-11ef-81bd-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"范宣子","people_name_jianti_auto":"范宣子","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"912aef6f-db0e-11ef-b50e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"襄","people_name_jianti_auto":"襄","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"912aef70-db0e-11ef-8507-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"齊侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐侯","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"912aef71-db0e-11ef-a0b6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"環","people_name_jianti_auto":"环","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"912aef72-db0e-11ef-a150-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"士匄","people_name_jianti_auto":"士匄","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"912aef73-db0e-11ef-8356-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"齊侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐侯","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"912aef74-db0e-11ef-bddc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"912aef75-db0e-11ef-b644-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"912aef76-db0e-11ef-bce7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"912aef77-db0e-11ef-a23c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"穀","place_name_jianti_auto":"谷","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"912aef78-db0e-11ef-8e0b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：士匄，晉大夫范宣子也。公羊傳：襄十九年，齊侯環卒。晉士匄帥師侵齊，至穀，聞齊侯卒，乃還。還者何？善辭也。大其不伐喪也。卒，子恤翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：士匄，晋大夫范宣子也。公羊传：襄十九年，齐侯环卒。晋士匄帅师侵齐，至谷，闻齐侯卒，乃还。还者何？善辞也。大其不伐丧也。卒，子恤翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":69,"tongjian_id":"912aef6c-db0e-11ef-a477-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"蘇林","people_name_jianti_auto":"苏林","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"912aef7b-db0e-11ef-9ee6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"912aef7c-db0e-11ef-95fd-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"仲馮","people_name_jianti_auto":"仲冯","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"912aef7d-db0e-11ef-be55-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"912aef7e-db0e-11ef-91f9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"912aef7f-db0e-11ef-a952-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"蘇林曰：弟，順也。師古曰：鄕，讀曰嚮。弟，音悌。仲馮曰：漢與匈奴嘗約爲兄弟，此弟直自爲弟耳。","note_content_jianti_auto":"苏林曰：弟，顺也。师古曰：鄕，读曰向。弟，音悌。仲冯曰：汉与匈奴尝约为兄弟，此弟直自为弟耳。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":96,"tongjian_id":"912aef7a-db0e-11ef-bf9f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"监察","official_name":"御史大夫","official_note":"御史大夫是漢代中央監察機構的最高長官，負責監察百官和處理奏章，此處在文中被皇帝詔問關於匈奴事務的意見，顯示其作為高級顧問的角色。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"詔問御史大夫蕭望之","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"efd34f8d-e3b3-400e-bb24-301f5dcdad70"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-46,"link_td_description":"萧望之，字长倩，东海郡兰陵县（今山东省临沂市兰陵县）人，西汉大臣、汉元帝帝师、儒家学者，历任大鸿胪、太傅等官。被后世谱牒家附会为萧何六世孙。","link_td_id":"Q10004019","link_td_number_id":1485174,"people_name":"蕭望之","people_name_jianti_auto":"萧望之","people_xingming":"萧望之","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"912aef80-db0e-11ef-b473-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-548,"link_td_description":"士匄，祁姓，士氏，按封地又为范氏，名匄，谥宣，又称范宣子，中国春秋时代晋国法家先驱、军事人物、政治人物。范文子士燮之子。","link_td_id":"Q10002617","link_td_number_id":1475715,"people_name":"士匄","people_name_jianti_auto":"士匄","people_xingming":"范宣子","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"912aef81-db0e-11ef-b46b-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-554,"link_td_description":"齐灵公，全谥为齐桓武灵公，姜姓，名环，在位期间有名相晏弱、晏婴父子相继辅政。母亲为声孟子。","link_td_id":"Q10000832","link_td_number_id":331602,"people_name":"齊侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐侯","people_xingming":"姜环","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"912aef82-db0e-11ef-9a0d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"912aef6b-db0e-11ef-b376-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"gài","source_anchor_text":"春秋晉士匄帥師侵齊","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":45,"text":"匄","tongjian_id":"4fa5ddbc-57e8-5893-a3c5-362ba9c50503"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","resolved_place_entity_id":9,"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"912aef83-db0e-11ef-aa27-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","resolved_place_entity_id":104,"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"912aef84-db0e-11ef-9ef1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","resolved_place_entity_id":110,"start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"912aef85-db0e-11ef-b8a7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","resolved_place_entity_id":25,"start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"912aef86-db0e-11ef-a006-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"汉匈战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0568"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["外交","史论"],"content":"漢議者多曰：「匈奴爲害日久，可因其壞亂，舉兵滅之。」詔問御史大夫蕭望之，對曰：「春秋，晉士匄帥師侵齊，聞齊侯卒，引師而還，君子大其不伐喪，以爲恩足以服孝子，誼足以動諸侯。前單于慕化鄕善，稱弟，遣使請求和親，海內欣然，夷狄莫不聞。未終奉約，不幸爲賊臣所殺；今而伐之，是乘亂而幸災也，彼必奔走遠遁。不以義動，兵恐勞而無功。宜遣使者弔問，輔其微弱，救其災患；四夷聞之，咸貴中國之仁義。如遂蒙恩得復其位，必稱臣服從，此德之盛也。」上從其議。","content_fanyi":"汉朝议者讨论匈奴问题时，多数认为：“匈奴为害时日已久，可趁其内部坏乱，发兵将它灭掉。”汉宣帝下诏询问御史大夫萧望之，萧望之回答说：“《春秋》记载，晋国的士匄率军攻齐，听说齐侯去世，便领兵撤回。君子称许他不趁对方有丧事而出兵，认为这样的恩德足以使孝子信服，这样的道义足以使诸侯感动。匈奴前任单于仰慕汉朝教化，一心向善，以汉朝之弟自称，派使者请求和亲，天下都很欣慰，夷狄没有不知道的。他尚未最终履行盟约，就不幸被贼臣杀害；现在如果讨伐匈奴，就是趁其祸乱而幸灾乐祸，他们必定向远方逃窜。不凭道义而出兵，军队恐怕会劳而无功。应当派遣使者吊唁慰问，扶助其微弱的力量，解救其灾难祸患；四方夷狄听说后，都会崇尚中国的仁义。如果匈奴能蒙受恩德而恢复单于之位，必定会向汉称臣服从，这才是盛大的德行。”汉宣帝采纳了萧望之的建议。","content_jianti_auto":"汉议者多曰：「匈奴为害日久，可因其坏乱，举兵灭之。」诏问御史大夫萧望之，对曰：「春秋，晋士匄帅师侵齐，闻齐侯卒，引师而还，君子大其不伐丧，以为恩足以服孝子，谊足以动诸侯。前单于慕化鄕善，称弟，遣使请求和亲，海内欣然，夷狄莫不闻。未终奉约，不幸为贼臣所杀；今而伐之，是乘乱而幸灾也，彼必奔走远遁。不以义动，兵恐劳而无功。宜遣使者吊问，辅其微弱，救其灾患；四夷闻之，咸贵中国之仁义。如遂蒙恩得复其位，必称臣服从，此德之盛也。」上从其议。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"呼韩邪入朝，丞相御史欲位之王侯之下，望之则曰：“待以不臣...","context_before":"...之是，是人之非，矫以与人立异，得非其果得，失非其固失也。","source_end_index":118,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"39482594-52ec-4156-93a8-9b6464425ccb","source_start_index":92,"source_text":"匈奴内溃，群臣议灭之，望之则曰：“不当乘乱而幸灾。”"}],"title":"一八 萧望之难以大受"}],"id":2124,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"912aef6b-db0e-11ef-b376-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"4冬，十有二月，乙酉朔，日有食之。","content_fanyi":"冬季，十二月，乙酉朔这一天，发生了日食。","content_jianti_auto":"4冬，十有二月，乙酉朔，日有食之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2125,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"912aef88-db0e-11ef-bbbd-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"912aef8b-db0e-11ef-b01f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"望之","people_name_jianti_auto":"望之","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"912aef8c-db0e-11ef-b594-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"延壽","people_name_jianti_auto":"延寿","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"912aef8d-db0e-11ef-b91d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：望之以延壽代己爲馮翊，而有能名出己之上，故忌害之，欲陷以罪法。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：望之以延寿代己为冯翊，而有能名出己之上，故忌害之，欲陷以罪法。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"912aef8a-db0e-11ef-a407-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"912aef8f-db0e-11ef-b9fa-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"左馮翊","place_name_jianti_auto":"左冯翊","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"912aef90-db0e-11ef-9fd1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"左馮翊屬官有廩犧令、丞、尉。師古曰：廩，主藏穀；犧，主養牲；皆所以供祭祀也。校，居孝翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"左冯翊属官有廪牺令、丞、尉。师古曰：廪，主藏谷；牺，主养牲；皆所以供祭祀也。校，居孝翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"912aef8e-db0e-11ef-8cb8-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"912aef94-db0e-11ef-8626-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"912aef95-db0e-11ef-a40b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"退齋","people_name_jianti_auto":"退斋","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"912aef96-db0e-11ef-82c8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：甲十五行本「日」下有「車服侍衞」四字；乙十一行本同；孔本同；退齋校同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：甲十五行本「日」下有「车服侍衞」四字；乙十一行本同；孔本同；退斋校同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"912aef93-db0e-11ef-8be6-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":130,"tongjian_id":"912aef92-db0e-11ef-9af9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"912aef98-db0e-11ef-b264-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"延壽","people_name_jianti_auto":"延寿","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"912aef99-db0e-11ef-ab99-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"延壽","people_name_jianti_auto":"延寿","start_index":113,"tongjian_id":"912aef9a-db0e-11ef-9bdb-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"延壽","people_name_jianti_auto":"延寿","start_index":122,"tongjian_id":"912aef9b-db0e-11ef-895f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","start_index":119,"tongjian_id":"912aef9c-db0e-11ef-9236-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：試騎士，每歲大試也。余謂卽都試也。據延壽傳：治飾兵車，畫龍、虎、朱爵。延壽衣黃紈方領，駕四馬，傅總，建幢棨、植羽葆，鼓車、歌車。功曹引車，皆駕四馬，建棨戟。五騎爲伍，分左右部，軍假司馬、千人持幢旁轂。歌者先居射室，望見延壽車，噭咷楚歌。延壽坐射室，騎吏持戟夾陛列立，騎士從者帶弓鞬羅後。令騎士、兵車四面營陳，被甲鞮鍪，居馬上，抱弩負籣。又使騎士戲車、弄馬、盜驂。所謂奢僭踰制者也。噭，音叫。咷，音他釣翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：试骑士，每岁大试也。余谓即都试也。据延寿传：治饰兵车，画龙、虎、朱爵。延寿衣黄纨方领，驾四马，傅总，建幢棨、植羽葆，鼓车、歌车。功曹引车，皆驾四马，建棨戟。五骑为伍，分左右部，军假司马、千人持幢旁毂。歌者先居射室，望见延寿车，噭咷楚歌。延寿坐射室，骑吏持戟夹陛列立，骑士从者带弓鞬罗后。令骑士、兵车四面营陈，被甲鞮鍪，居马上，抱弩负籣。又使骑士戏车、弄马、盗骖。所谓奢僭逾制者也。噭，音叫。咷，音他钓翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":135,"tongjian_id":"912aef97-db0e-11ef-854d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"912aefa0-db0e-11ef-adae-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：甲十五行本無「劍」字；乙十一行本同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：甲十五行本无「剑」字；乙十一行本同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"912aef9f-db0e-11ef-8133-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":148,"tongjian_id":"912aef9e-db0e-11ef-a4a0-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Chi